{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/tools/layout,_N_T_/tools/sleep-calculator/layout,_N_T_/tools/sleep-calculator/page,_N_T_/tools/sleep-calculator"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--30Dh3F_gwThwhWHzEqvhC--><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/d2c1ffb734f61872-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/be89a9700d24476f.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/b060768bd19d627c.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-afaa36114f407091.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-cb395327542b56ef.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-e48a0c0fd545761a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-e78f5894d0a0b16c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/tools/page-f6d4c9d14c709db5.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/tools/sleep-calculator/page-19922c7933f6e187.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-3591490977493759\" as=\"script\" crossorigin=\"\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>쓱싹 - 유용한 정보 블로그</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그. 금융, 건강, IT, 생활정보 등 쉽게 알려드립니다.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"금융, 투자, 건강, IT, 테크, 생활정보, 자격증, 보험\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta name=\"publisher\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><meta name=\"google-adsense-account\" content=\"ca-pub-3591490977493759\"/><meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"05uSSCwIsJLxLnMlswVBzMSOwEeGCOkpMhx9YJMZcng\"/><meta name=\"naver-site-verification\" content=\"f82b9ef52a15379f29a3f6d9ffe4dd6b9d6cc43b\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"쓱싹 - 유용한 정보 블로그\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://sseuksak.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"ko_KR\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://sseuksak.com/og-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"쓱싹\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"쓱싹 - 유용한 정보 블로그\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://sseuksak.com/og-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"url\":\"https://sseuksak.com\",\"name\":\"쓱싹\",\"description\":\"다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그\",\"inLanguage\":\"ko-KR\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":\"https://sseuksak.com/search?q={search_term_string}\",\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"쓱싹\",\"url\":\"https://sseuksak.com\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://sseuksak.com/logo.svg\"},\"sameAs\":[],\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer service\",\"availableLanguage\":\"Korean\"}}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"__className_9f2754 antialiased bg-white\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white border-b border-gray-200\"><nav class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center h-16\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600\">쓱싹</span></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-8\"><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/finance\">금융/투자</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/insurance\">보험/법률</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/health\">건강/의료</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/tech\">IT/테크</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/education\">교육/자격증</a><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/category/lifestyle\">생활정보</a></div><button class=\"md:hidden p-2 rounded-md text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-100\" aria-label=\"메뉴 열기\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></nav></header><main class=\"flex-grow\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\"><nav class=\"mb-6\"><a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/tools\">← 도구 목록으로</a></nav><div class=\"text-center mb-8\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">수면 사이클 계산기</h1><p class=\"text-gray-600\">90분 수면 사이클에 맞춰 일어나면 개운하게 기상할 수 있어요</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-6\"><div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-6\"><button class=\"flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors bg-blue-600 text-white\">일어나야 할 시간</button><button class=\"flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-200\">자야 할 시간</button></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-2\">기상 시간을 선택하세요</label><input type=\"time\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 text-2xl text-center border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500\" value=\"07:00\"/></div><button class=\"w-full py-3 bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors\">계산하기</button></div><div class=\"mt-8 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">수면의 4단계</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">하나의 수면 사이클(90분)은 4개의 단계로 구성돼요. 각 단계마다 몸과 뇌에서 다른 일이 일어나요.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><div class=\"p-4 rounded-lg border bg-blue-100 border-blue-300\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">N1 (입면기)</span><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 ml-auto\">1~7분</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">깨어있는 상태에서 잠으로 전환되는 단계. 쉽게 깨어날 수 있고, 근육이 경련하는 &quot;hypnic jerks&quot;가 발생할 수 있어요.</p></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-lg border bg-indigo-100 border-indigo-300\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">N2 (얕은 수면)</span><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 ml-auto\">전체의 ~50%</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">체온이 떨어지고 심박수가 느려져요. 기억 통합이 시작되며, 깊은 수면으로 가는 관문이에요.</p></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-lg border bg-purple-100 border-purple-300\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">N3 (깊은 수면)</span><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 ml-auto\">전체의 ~20%</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">가장 회복적인 단계! 성장 호르몬이 분비되고, 조직 복구와 면역력 강화가 이루어져요. 이 단계에서 깨면 매우 피곤해요.</p></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-lg border bg-pink-100 border-pink-300\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">REM (렘수면)</span><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 ml-auto\">전체의 ~25%</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">꿈을 꾸는 단계! 뇌가 활발하게 활동하며, 기억력과 감정 조절에 중요해요. 눈이 빠르게 움직여요.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">연령별 권장 수면 시간 (CDC 기준)</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">신생아 (0-3개월)</p><p class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">14-17시간</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">영아 (4-12개월)</p><p class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">12-16시간</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">유아 (1-2세)</p><p class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">11-14시간</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">미취학 (3-5세)</p><p class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">10-13시간</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">학령기 (6-12세)</p><p class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">9-12시간</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">청소년 (13-18세)</p><p class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">8-10시간</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">성인 (18-60세)</p><p class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">7시간 이상</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1\">노년 (61세 이상)</p><p class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">7-9시간</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl border border-red-200 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">수면 부족이 미치는 영향</h3><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-200 text-red-800 text-sm font-medium rounded-full whitespace-nowrap\">24시간</span><span class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">혈중 알코올 0.1%와 비슷한 인지능력 저하</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-200 text-red-800 text-sm font-medium rounded-full whitespace-nowrap\">17시간</span><span class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">반응속도와 판단력 저하 시작</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-200 text-red-800 text-sm font-medium rounded-full whitespace-nowrap\">36시간+</span><span class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">기억력, 면역력, 심혈관 건강에 영향</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 bg-green-50 rounded-xl border border-green-200 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">더 나은 수면을 위한 팁</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 text-sm\">환경</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li>• 침실 온도는 15-19°C가 이상적</li><li>• 암막 커튼으로 빛 차단</li><li>• 조용한 환경 유지 (백색소음 OK)</li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 text-sm\">피해야 할 것</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li>• 취침 6시간 전 카페인</li><li>• 취침 3시간 전 과식</li><li>• 취침 전 블루라이트 (핸드폰)</li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 text-sm\">습관</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li>• 매일 같은 시간 취침/기상</li><li>• 30분 이상 낮잠은 피하기</li><li>• 침대는 수면용으로만 사용</li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 text-sm\">취침 전</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li>• 30분 전 조명 어둡게</li><li>• 따뜻한 물로 샤워/족욕</li><li>• 가벼운 스트레칭이나 독서</li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3\">수면 사이클이란?</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li>• 수면은 약 <strong>90~110분</strong> 단위의 사이클로 구성돼요</li><li>• 사이클이 끝나는 시점(얕은 수면)에 일어나면 개운해요</li><li>• 깊은 수면(N3) 중간에 일어나면 피곤하고 머리가 무거워요</li><li>• 성인 기준 <strong>5~6사이클(7.5~9시간)</strong>이 적정 수면이에요</li><li>• 밤이 깊어질수록 REM 수면 비율이 높아지고, 꿈을 더 많이 꿔요</li></ul><div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">참고: sleepopolis.com, CDC Sleep Guidelines</p></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-200\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">쓱싹</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">다양한 주제의 유용한 정보를 제공하는 블로그입니다. 금융, 건강, IT 등 생활에 도움이 되는 정보를 쉽게 알려드립니다.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">바로가기</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/about\">소개</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/contact\">연락처</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/privacy\">개인정보처리방침</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/terms\">이용약관</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">카테고리</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/category/finance\">금융/투자</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/category/health\">건강/의료</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/category/tech\">IT/테크</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600 text-sm\" href=\"/category/lifestyle\">생활정보</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200\"><p class=\"text-center text-gray-500 text-sm\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> 쓱싹. All rights reserved.</p></div></div></footer></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunk